/** Reproduce the seeded construction plan of each panel case (planner only, no
 * compile) exactly as tools/eval/eval.ts → compileHandoff → compileProductionRepertoire
 * call it, and write section → {construction, guidance, railLayout}.
 *   node --import tsx plan.ts OUT.json */
